    "sampleAnswer": "Use a tiered architecture: object storage for source documents,\nan asynchronous ingestion pipeline for parsing/chunking/embedding, a\nscalable vector or hybrid index, and a low-latency query service.\n\nAt query time, authenticate the user, apply ACL and metadata filters,\nembed or rewrite the query, retrieve a bounded candidate set, optionally\nrerank it, and send only the strongest evidence to the model. Cache safe\nrepeated queries or embeddings where appropriate.\n\nScale retrieval horizontally, keep indexes memory-efficient, measure\np50/p95/p99 latency, and separate retrieval latency from LLM generation\nlatency. Quality must be evaluated alongside latency because aggressive\noptimization can reduce recall.",
