    "sampleAnswer": "Build the chatbot around a trusted support knowledge base.\nIngest and normalize FAQs, product documentation, policies, and approved\nsupport articles; chunk and embed them; retain metadata such as product,\nversion, locale, and publication status.\n\nAt runtime, authenticate the customer, retrieve relevant authorized\ncontent using hybrid/vector search and optional reranking, and ask the\nmodel to answer using the retrieved evidence. If evidence is\ninsufficient, the bot should ask a clarifying question or escalate\nrather than fabricate an answer.\n\nMeasure retrieval recall, groundedness, resolution rate, escalation\nrate, customer satisfaction, latency, and cost. Continuously evaluate\nstale or conflicting documentation.",
